{"id":140943395,"slug":"trauma-therapy-you-dont-need-to-talk","title":"Trauma Therapy You Don't Need To Talk About","subtitle":"A conversation about the PRISM System for PTSD with Jeremy Fox, P.C.","post_date":"2024-01-22T22:24:19.313Z","audience":"everyone","type":"podcast","canonical_url":"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/trauma-therapy-you-dont-need-to-talk","wordcount":187,"source":"api","fetched_at":"2026-09-13T21:54:55.470Z","body_sha256":"67d8e61462fc7bca29bbd7656ce38cc431ae4c3cd5369f34d612ddefe59dcff5","text_words":186,"complete":true,"body_html":"<p>I checked in with Jeremy Fox, P.C., about a new FDA-cleared device, the <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.psychres.2023.115711\">PRISM system by GrayMatters Health.</a>  This is a treatment modality for Post Traumatic Stress Disorder that doesn't require talking about your trauma!  <span class=\"mention-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;@Psych Fox&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:15519985,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;user&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:null,&quot;photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/6b7df465-6795-42fd-809c-11b4fdf6c64f_396x394.jpeg&quot;,&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;46607c37-9753-4cba-a314-773311add40a&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"MentionToDOM\"></span>  is one of my favorite trauma therapists, so I called him to discuss.</p><p>This is now offered at four sites in the US, and <a href=\"https://www.fermata.health\">Fermata</a> in Brooklyn, NY, is one of them.  I discuss the experience of having PTSD myself and the role of trauma exposure in medical training and practice.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!_V6N!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F712c2922-96e6-4190-aaf9-7e93a94efaac_1179x1136.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-in